# Nothing in this project needs building or installing: the site is plain
# HTML/CSS/JS and runs from a static server. These entries exist so that
# local experiments and OS junk stay out of commits.

# Test oracles (qrcode, jsqr, pdfjs-dist, @napi-rs/canvas, jsdom). The tests look
# for them outside the repo — /tmp/oracle by default, or QR_ORACLE_DIR, or a
# gitignored .oracle/ here. Nothing in the shipped site uses them.
# See tests/oracle.js and CONTRIBUTING.md#the-dev-only-oracles.
node_modules/
.oracle/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local artifacts
/tmp/
*.log
profile-data/*.local.json

# Generated per-username stubs (`npm run build`, and the Pages workflow on every
# push). Derived from profile-data/, so committing them would leave a stale URL
# behind when someone renames a profile. 404.html boots the same renderer for any
# /c/<username>/ path, so a deployment without them still works.
# profile-data/index.json and c/index.html ARE committed: they are small, stable,
# and make a plain branch deploy work with no tooling at all.
/c/*/
